      "created_at": "2014-04-30T22:31:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Im confused on the \"play a hero card\" and \"use a power\" parts of the hero turn. &nbsp;Lets say I play a card that has just a power on it, do I :&nbsp;</p><p>1. Play just that card and then another power? (I.e put in play the wraiths Throwing knives card that just has a power on it and then play her character card power)&nbsp;</p><p>2. Put in play that card then the power on that card equaling one card turn and one power turn.</p><p>3. Put in Play that card then its power (for one turn) then another power (i.e play the wraiths throwing knives card and its power THEN play the power on her character card) &nbsp;</p><p>Sorry everyone im new to the game and still trying to figure things out. &nbsp;Thanks to everyone who takes the time to help. &nbsp;</p><p>Much appreciated. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
