      "id": 100680,
      "name": "TeslaRoyale",
      "username": "TeslaRoyale",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/9fc29f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-30T22:38:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Playing a card with a power on it and using a power are two seperate things.  You play the card like any other card but playing it does not trigger it’s power.  When you move to the power phase if you have two things that have a power keyword on them such as your character card and say motavational charge for instance you select one of the effects that has the word power next to it to use.  Playing a card with a power on it gives you access to additional powers to choose from but not more activations.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:29:03.804Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
