      "username": "Theta_Sigma",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/theta_sigma/{size}/1929_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-01T08:37:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just because I've had a couple of people ask me this, going to mention: You can play a card with the keyword power on it in your play phase and activate that power in the power phase right after playing. There is no minimum time a card needs to be out before you can activate it.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:29:03.968Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 10262,
      "topic_slug": "im-confused",
      "display_username": "Theta_Sigma",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Just because I&#39;ve had a couple of people ask me this, going to mention: You can play a card with the keyword power on it in your play phase and activate that power in the power phase right after playing. There is no minimum time a card needs to be out before you can activate it.</p>",
