      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Also, if something lets you use two powers in a turn, you can&#39;t use the same card&#39;s power twice. That is, if you have one copy of Stun Bolt out and can use two powers (in this case, quite likely considering this particular card is Wraith&#39;s so there&#39;s her lovely Utility Belt likely to find its way into play hopefully ASAP ;)), you can&#39;t use the Stun Bolt power twice. If you have [i]two[/i] copies of Stun Bolt out, however (as it&#39;s not Limited), you can activate both of them as they are two separate [i]copies[/i] of a card, therefore two separate powers.\n\nI think the only time when you can get around this is in the case of Mr Fixer (one of the Rook City heroes), who has a one-shot which specifically states he can use his base power twice that turn (note that if someone else lets him play this card on [i]their[/i] turn, he can use his power twice at any point during that hero&#39;s turn, because it specifies &quot;this turn&quot; so it&#39;s valid until that hero&#39;s turn is over and is separate from their own play/power/draw phases ;)).\n",
